Third-party content
-------------------

The MIT grant above covers the source in this repository. It does not purport
to grant rights in the wave-runner asset used by the demo:

  demo/craftModel.js   mesh and inlined base-colour texture, generated with
                       Meshy.ai and converted by tools/glb.mjs

Whether that asset may be redistributed, and under what terms, depends on the
plan it was generated under. It is used only by the demo application; the
library published as the `abyssal-ocean` package (the `src/` directory) contains
no third-party assets, no bundled models and no bundled textures.
